-- src:15136 | section 173A(1)(b) to the Registrar if the director has reasonable
-- src:15137 | cause to believe that the company will not do so.
@ref s 173E(2) (src:15133-15137)
-- src:15141 | (3) A secretary who resigns from office and who has given notice of
-- src:15142 | his or her resignation to the company, or a secretary who is removed
-- src:15147 | or retires from office, may give the notice referred to in
-- src:15148 | section 173A(1)(b) to the Registrar if the secretary has reasonable
-- src:15149 | cause to believe that the company will not do so.
@ref s 173E(3) (src:15141-15149)
-- src:15153 | (4) A director, chief executive officer or secretary who has changed
-- src:15154 | his or her residential address or contact address (as the case may be)
-- src:15155 | which is entered in the register of directors, register of chief executive
-- src:15156 | officers or register of secretaries kept by the Registrar under
-- src:15157 | section 173, or an auditor who has changed the auditor’s address
