-- src:15174 | of section 148, 149, 149A, 154, 155, 155A, 155C or 155D —
-- src:15176 | (a) from being a director of the company; or
-- src:15178 | (b) from acting as a director of the company,
-- src:15180 | the Registrar may on his or her own initiative amend the register of
-- src:15181 | directors of the company kept by the Registrar under section 173 to
-- src:15182 | indicate that the person has been disqualified from being or acting as
-- src:15183 | a director (as the case may be) by virtue of that fact.
@ref s 173F(1) (src:15172-15183)
-- src:15187 | (1A) Where the Registrar has reasonable cause to believe that a
