-- src:15189 | initiative amend the register of directors of the company kept by the
-- src:15190 | Registrar under section 173 to indicate that the person has ceased to
-- src:15191 | be a director by virtue of that fact.
@ref s 173F(1A) (src:15187-15191)
-- src:15195 | (2) Where the Registrar has reasonable cause to believe that a chief
