-- src:15203 | person has ceased to be a chief executive officer of the company by
-- src:15204 | virtue of that fact.
@ref s 173F(2) (src:15195-15204)
-- src:15208 | (3) Where the Registrar has reasonable cause to believe that a
-- src:15209 | secretary of a company is dead, the Registrar may on his or her own
-- src:15210 | initiative amend the register of secretaries of the company kept by the
-- src:15211 | Registrar under section 173 to indicate that the person has ceased to
-- src:15212 | be a secretary of the company by virtue of that fact.
@ref s 173F(3) (src:15208-15212)
-- src:15216 | (4) Where the Registrar has reasonable cause to believe that the
-- src:15217 | auditor of a company —
-- src:15219 | (a) has had its registration as an accounting entity suspended
-- src:15220 | or removed; or
-- src:15222 | (b) being an individual is dead,
-- src:15224 | the Registrar may on his or her own initiative amend the register of
